Spec: TODO App

Platform: JavaScript/ES6

Purpose:
  Single-page TODO application built with Vanilla JS ES6 and OOP.

Structure:
  ./app.sdd: Root application spec.
  ./models/: Domain models and colocated model specs.
  ./services/: Business logic, persistence adapters, and colocated service specs.
  ./components/: UI components and colocated component specs.
  ./index.html: Application entry point.
  ./main.js: Browser bootstrap that mounts @App into the DOM.
  ./components/*.sdd: Component-level SpecDD contracts.
  ./models/*.sdd: Model-level SpecDD contracts.
  ./services/*.sdd: Service-level SpecDD contracts.

Owns:
  Application architecture and source-tree boundaries.
  ./app.sdd
  ./index.html
  ./main.js
  ./components/*.sdd
  ./models/*.sdd
  ./services/*.sdd

Can modify:
  ./app.sdd
  ./index.html
  ./main.js
  ./components/*.sdd
  ./models/*.sdd
  ./services/*.sdd

Can read:
  ./**
  ../tests/**

Must:
  Use ES6 classes for all logic and UI components.
  Use OOP.
  No inline JavaScript is permitted.
  Separate model, service, and component responsibilities.
  Keep DOM manipulation inside components.
  Keep business logic inside services.
  Persist TODO state across page reloads in local storage.
  Maintain SRP for all services and features.
  Follow best JavaScript development practices.

Must not:
  Use external frameworks or libraries.
  Mix business logic into components.
  Access localStorage directly from components.

Forbids:
  jQuery
  React
  Vue
  Angular
